Jeroen, I created PO 4500123456 on 14 Oct (4,000 EUR pallets, EUR 12,480 tota=
l, so EUR 3.12 each). It has been sitting in 'awaiting release' since then. B=
ecause the value is above EUR 10,000 it needs release code 02, and the ME21N =
workflow still sends the approval task to a colleague who moved to Antwerp in=
 September. Nobody in Rotterdam or Venlo ever sees the work item, which is wh=
y nothing happened for almost a week. I did not notice earlier because I assu=
med the approver was just slow. I am raising it with IT right now and will ke=
ep you posted.

Thanks,
